loader-plist-gamemode.patch - Gamify patch over CrossOver 25.1.0 Wine (loader), LGPL-2.1-or-later.
Game Mode eligibility keys in the Info.plist that is linked into bin/wine (wineloader) as
__TEXT,__info_plist: LSApplicationCategoryType = public.app-category.games, GCSupportsGameMode and
LSSupportsGameMode = true. macOS turns Game Mode on when such an app is frontmost and full screen.
Details: docs/codeweavers-patches.md "Ported from CrossOver 26.1".

--- a/loader/wine_info.plist.in	2026-10-22 21:08:56
+++ b/loader/wine_info.plist.in	2026-10-22 21:09:57
@@ -26,5 +26,12 @@
     <string>WineApplication</string>
     <key>LSUIElement</key>
     <string>1</string>
+    <!-- Gamify: Game Mode eligibility (macOS turns it on for a frontmost full-screen game) -->
+    <key>LSApplicationCategoryType</key>
+    <string>public.app-category.games</string>
+    <key>GCSupportsGameMode</key>
+    <true/>
+    <key>LSSupportsGameMode</key>
+    <true/>
 </dict>
 </plist>
